dmenu - dynamic menu (with Hiroshi's patches)
====================
The formatting of this document was left as is, cuz why not.

Patches include:

- Tab + Shift-Tab keybinds for moving the cursor between options.
- A `-c` option for making dmenu "float" in the center of the screen.

Testing
------------
I used gdb to debug in a nested X environment using Xephyr.  

To start the environment:
```
Xephyr :1 -screen 1280x800 2>&1 /dev/null &
```  

After starting gdb, you can enter the following to use the nested environment for testing:
```
set environment DISPLAY :1
```
